    "raw_source": "Compute a **score**.\n\nExtended *prose* and ``code``.\n\nParameters\n----------\nx, y : float, optional, default=1\n    Input values.\n\nReturns\n-------\nscore : float\n    The score.\n\nRaises\n------\nValueError\n    Invalid input.\n\nNotes\n-----\nKeep the scale.\n\nReferences\n----------\n.. [1] A. Author, Study.\n\nExamples\n--------\n>>> score(1, 2)\n3\n",
